# Copy to vpn.env (never commit it). Gluetun, the VPN the download clients go through:
# https://github.com/qdm12/gluetun-wiki, one page per provider. Keep one block.

# --- ProtonVPN, WireGuard, with port forwarding ---------------------------------------------
# Paid plan. At https://account.proton.me/u/0/vpn/WireGuard, create a configuration for
# GNU/Linux with "NAT-PMP (Port Forwarding)" on, and copy its PrivateKey here. Gluetun then only
# picks P2P servers and gives qBittorrent the port Proton forwards.
VPN_SERVICE_PROVIDER=protonvpn
VPN_TYPE=wireguard
WIREGUARD_PRIVATE_KEY=
SERVER_COUNTRIES=Switzerland,Netherlands
PORT_FORWARD_ONLY=on
VPN_PORT_FORWARDING=on

# --- Private Internet Access, OpenVPN, with port forwarding ---------------------------------
# VPN_SERVICE_PROVIDER=private internet access
# OPENVPN_USER=
# OPENVPN_PASSWORD=
# SERVER_REGIONS=Netherlands
# PORT_FORWARD_ONLY=on
# VPN_PORT_FORWARDING=on

# --- AirVPN, WireGuard: the port is forwarded in AirVPN's client area --------------------------
# VPN_SERVICE_PROVIDER=airvpn
# VPN_TYPE=wireguard
# WIREGUARD_PRIVATE_KEY=
# WIREGUARD_PRESHARED_KEY=
# WIREGUARD_ADDRESSES=
# SERVER_COUNTRIES=Netherlands
# FIREWALL_VPN_INPUT_PORTS=
# Then set the same port in qBittorrent (Options, Connection).

# --- Mullvad, WireGuard (no port forwarding: fewer peers) ----------------------------------
# VPN_SERVICE_PROVIDER=mullvad
# VPN_TYPE=wireguard
# WIREGUARD_PRIVATE_KEY=
# WIREGUARD_ADDRESSES=
# SERVER_CITIES=Amsterdam

# --- Any provider from a WireGuard configuration file ------------------------------------
# VPN_SERVICE_PROVIDER=custom
# VPN_TYPE=wireguard
# WIREGUARD_ENDPOINT_IP=
# WIREGUARD_ENDPOINT_PORT=51820
# WIREGUARD_PUBLIC_KEY=
# WIREGUARD_PRIVATE_KEY=
# WIREGUARD_ADDRESSES=
